# Citation File Format 1.2.0 — https://citation-file-format.github.io
# GitHub renders a "Cite this repository" button from this file, and Zenodo
# reads it when archiving a release. Keep version, date-released and doi in
# step with conf.py and the Zenodo deposit.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolbox, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "VoxelWise Toolbox"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, dependency-free MATLAB library for human fMRI analysis. All
  brain data is held in a single fixed layout — the 228453 in-brain voxels of
  the MNI152 2 mm template — so any of the 83 functions composes with any
  other. Aimed particularly at continuous-feature and naturalistic paradigms.
type: software
authors:
